<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>FGIC said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Peoria, Ill., $3 million of general obligation bonds under the direct purchase program.</p>
<p>--Lockport City School District, N.Y., $7 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Beaver Area SD, Pa., $13.8 million of GO bonds under the alternate bidding program.</p>
<p>--Kilgore, Texas, $4.5 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
